Package: acd
Type: Package
Title: Vienna Area Climate Design (ACD) Building-Zone Linkage
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("John", "Gavin", email = "john.b.gavin@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Proof-of-concept R package linking Vienna's Energieraumpläne (ACD zones)
    to the building inventory (Gebäudeinformation) via spatial join. Includes spatial
    join with diagnostic link_status enum, interactive Quarto dashboard, and committed
    snapshot data (Parquet format).
